WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.730
Corinth: a Roman colony full of trade,
travellers and admired speakers.

2
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:09.490
Its young church sends worrying
news through Chloe's household.

3
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.030
Believers are taking sides.

4
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.350
I follow Paul.

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.680
I follow Apollos.

6
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.320
I follow Cephas.

7
00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:21.080
So how did Paul try to bring a church
of rival fan clubs back together?

8
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:24.390
In this mission, you'll map the
problems tearing at Corinth,

9
00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.110
chapter by chapter.

10
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.830
Then you'll explore the images Paul uses:

11
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.490
milk, a field, a building and a temple.

12
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:36.750
Your mission: find out how Paul
tried to heal a divided church.
